  <entryLinks>
    <entryLink id="6b36-d1b3-cba5-f217" name="Divisio Tactica: The Titan Legions" hidden="false" collective="false" import="false" targetId="47f0-bba9-6d89-9baa" type="selectionEntry">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="add" field="category" value="7b69-bf2f-4547-e83b">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="5430-5be1-1613-be44" type="instanceOf"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="9b71-5246-c019-3c96" type="min"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="177e-7277-68b4-68c6" name="Advanced Reaction: Interlocking Phalanx (Assault Phase)" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">Trigger: This Advanced Reaction may be declared in the Assault phase, immediately after an enemy unit declares a Charge against a friendly unit composed entirely of models with the Secutarii special rule (or declares a Charge against a friendly model with the Titan Unit Type while at least one friendly unit with the Secutarii special rule is within 6" of that Titan).
Effect: Every model in the reacting Secutarii unit gains the Counter-Attack (1) special rule until the end of the current Assault phase, and improves its Kyropatris Field Generator Invulnerable Save by +1 (to a maximum of 4+) during the ensuing Fight sub-phase. Furthermore, if the enemy unit declared a Charge against a friendly Titan, the reacting Secutarii unit may immediately make a free Charge move of up to 6" into base contact with the charging enemy unit before the enemy unit moves (provided the Secutarii unit is not locked in combat, Pinned, or Falling Back).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="621d-1f6f-879a-8d71" name="Advanced Reaction: Void-Shield Overload (Shooting Phase)" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">Trigger: This Advanced Reaction may be declared in the Shooting phase, immediately after an enemy unit selects a friendly model with the Titan Unit Type (or a friendly unit with the Secutarii special rule within 6" of a friendly Titan with at least one active Void Shield) as the target of a Shooting Attack, before any To Hit rolls are made.
Effect: Until the end of that Shooting Attack, the reacting Titan's active Void Shields gain a 3+ Invulnerable Save (instead of the normal 4+ Void Shield save, or blocking hits on a 3+ before collapsing), and any friendly Secutarii unit within 6" of that Titan gains a 4+ Invulnerable Save against that Shooting Attack. At the end of that Shooting Attack, roll a D6: on a 1, the reacting Titan immediately loses 1 active Void Shield due to capacitor burnout.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="277b-dd85-3a29-3e6d" name="Allegiance:" hidden="false" targetId="e90d-e5a8-f42d-da84" primary="true"/>
      </categoryLinks>
    </entryLink>
