        </rule>
        <rule name="Note" id="89b0-b284-f741-3db7" hidden="false">
          <description>A Moderati Recon Foot-Patrol numbering 10 models or fewer may take a Termite Assault Drill as a Dedicated Transport. Support Squad: it may not be a Compulsory Troops choice and does not have the Line Unit Sub-type.</description>
